---
title: META-HARNESS Artifact Promotion State Machine
---
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Draft: create artifact

    Draft --> Research: attach RDD linkage\nadd sources and hypotheses
    Draft --> Deprecated: abandon before review

    Research --> Draft: insufficient evidence\nor scope reset
    Research --> Validated: pass schema checks\npass research sufficiency gate
    Research --> Deprecated: research invalidated

    Validated --> Research: validation defect\nrequires additional evidence
    Validated --> Canonical: reviewer approval\nimplementation traceability confirmed
    Validated --> Deprecated: superseded before canonicalization

    Canonical --> Validated: regression review\ncanonical status challenged
    Canonical --> Superseded: replacement canonical artifact approved
    Canonical --> Deprecated: domain retired

    Superseded --> [*]
    Deprecated --> [*]

    state Draft {
        [*] --> Drafting
        Drafting --> LocalReview: author self-check
        LocalReview --> Drafting: revisions required
        LocalReview --> [*]: ready for research gate
    }

    state Research {
        [*] --> SourceCapture
        SourceCapture --> EvidenceSynthesis
        EvidenceSynthesis --> RDDTraceability
        RDDTraceability --> [*]: research gate passed
    }

    state Validated {
        [*] --> SchemaValidation
        SchemaValidation --> SemanticValidation
        SemanticValidation --> SpatialValidation
        SpatialValidation --> ImplementationValidation
        ImplementationValidation --> [*]: validation gate passed
    }

    state Canonical {
        [*] --> CanonicalRegistry
        CanonicalRegistry --> ChangeMonitoring
        ChangeMonitoring --> [*]: remains canonical
    }

